From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 19:13:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Improve poll configuration in the compose form

- Replace dropdowns with a slider and radio buttons
- Create a utility module to manage poll durations
- Implement snap points for intuitive duration selection
- Update CSS to support the new interactive UI components
- Add test suites for the poll duration logic

Rationale: Enhancing the poll interface with interactive elements improves usability and provides a more intuitive experience for configuring expiration times and multiple-choice settings.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

